# Machine-local overrides are never tracked — they live in $HOME, not here,
# but guard against a stray copy landing in the repo.
*.local
*.local.ps1
profile.local.ps1

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# Nothing generated is tracked. Rendered PDF/HTML output goes to archive/,
# which IS tracked deliberately — see archive/ in README.md.
